            Tabel Rincian Harga &amp; Matriks Fitur ZWCAD 2026
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2">
            Bandingkan paket lisensi Standalone dan Network Floating untuk memilih solusi CAD yang paling tepat guna bagi perusahaan Anda.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse min-w-[720px]">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-slate-900 text-white text-sm">
                <th class="py-4 px-5 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider w-1/3">Edisi / Spesifikasi</th>
                <th class="py-4 px-5 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-center w-2/9">ZWCAD Standard</th>
                <th class="py-4 px-5 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-center w-2/9 bg-blue-700 text-white">
                  ZWCAD Professional
                  <span class="block text-[10px] font-normal text-amber-300">Paling Populer</span>
                </th>
                <th class="py-4 px-5 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-center w-2/9">ZWCAD MFG</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200 text-sm">
              <tr class="bg-slate-50/80 font-semibold text-slate-900">
                <td class="py-3.5 px-5">Harga Lisensi Standalone (1 User)</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-5 text-center text-blue-700 font-extrabold">IDR 15.300.000</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-5 text-center text-blue-700 font-extrabold bg-blue-50/40">IDR 23.800.000</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-5 text-center text-blue-700 font-extrabold">IDR 28.900.000</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-slate-50/80 font-semibold text-slate-900">
                <td class="py-3.5 px-5">Harga Lisensi Network (Multi-User LAN)</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-5 text-center text-blue-700 font-extrabold">IDR 17.030.000</td>
