                <td class="py-3.5 px-5 text-center text-emerald-600 font-bold">✓ Lengkap</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-5 font-medium text-slate-700">Dukungan API &amp; Otomasi Script</td>
